turated fat, in ascending proportion from light cream to heavy cream."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"ingredient-cream"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cream"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's cooked with","count":31,"groups":[["Basque cuisine","cuisine/basque-cuisine",[["Basque cheesecake","dish/basque-cheesecake"],["Goxua","dish/goxua"],["Intxaursaltsa","dish/intxaursaltsa"]]],["French cuisine","cuisine/french-cuisine",[["Brioche","dish/brioche"],["Flammekueche","dish/flammekueche"],["Fraisier","dish/fraisier"]]],["New Caledonian cuisine","cuisine/new-caledonian-cuisine",[["Brioche","dish/brioche"],["Flammekueche","dish/flammekueche"],["Fraisier","dish/fraisier"]]],["Portuguese cuisine","cuisine/portuguese-cuisine",[["Bacalhau com natas","dish/bacalhau-com-natas"],["Bolo de bolacha","dish/bolo-de-bolacha"],["Serradura","dish/serradura"]]],["Danish cuisine","cuisine/danish-cuisine",[["Æbleskiver","dish/bleskiver"],["Risalamande","dish/risalamande"]]],["Italian cuisine","cuisine/italian-cuisine",[["Panna cotta","dish/panna-cotta"],["Stracciatella (ice cream)","dish/stracciatella-ice-cream"]]],["Italian-American cuisine","cuisine/italian-american-cuisine",[["Tetrazzini","dish/tetrazzini"],["Vodka sauce","dish/vodka-sauce"]]],["Russian cuisine","cuisine/russian-cuisine",[["Pozharsky cutlet","dish/pozharsky-cutlet"],["Székelykáposzta","dish/szekelykaposzta"]]],["Swedish cuisine","cuisine/swedish-cuisine",[["Flying Jacob","dish/flying-jacob"],["Ostkaka","dish/ostkaka"]]],["Ukrainian cuisine","cuisine/ukrainian-cuisine",[["Banosh","dish/banosh"],["Smetana (dairy product)","dish/smetana-dairy-product"]]],["American cuisine","cuisine/american-cuisine",[["Chowder","dish/chowder"]]],["Belgian cuisine","cuisine/belgian-cuisine",[["Waterzooi","dish/waterzooi"]]],["British cuisine","cuisine/british-cuisine",[["Black pudding","dish/black-pudding"]]],["Czech cuisine","cuisine/czech-cuisine",[["Székelykáposzta","dish/szekelykaposzta"]]],["